In the circuit, when Z is set to 1 , the operands to full adder are \(X, \bar{Y}\) and input carry is 1
<br/>So,<br/>\[\begin{aligned}
\mathrm{F} &amp; =\mathrm{X}+\overline{\mathrm{Y}}+1 \\
&amp; =\mathrm{X}+2 \text { 's complement of } \mathrm{Y} \\
&amp; =\mathrm{X}-\mathrm{Y}
\end{aligned}\]

\(V_{0}=-R\left(\frac{b_{3} V_{R E F}}{R}+\frac{b_{2} V_{R E F}}{2 R}+\frac{b_{1} V_{R E F}}{4 R}+\frac{b_{0} V_{R E F}}{8 R}\right)\)<br/>
\(=-\frac{\mathrm{V}_{\text {REF }} \times \mathrm{R}}{\mathrm{R}}\left[\mathrm{b}_{3}+\frac{\mathrm{b}_{2}}{2}+\frac{\mathrm{b}_{1}}{4}+\frac{\mathrm{b}_{0}}{8}\right]\)<br/>
\(=-V_{\text {REF }}\left[\mathrm{b}_{3}+\frac{\mathrm{b}_{2}}{2}+\frac{\mathrm{b}_{1}}{4}+\frac{\mathrm{b}_{0}}{8}\right]\)<br/>
For the input \(\mathrm{b}_{3} \mathrm{~b}_{2} \mathrm{~b}_{1} \mathrm{~b}_{0}=1110\), the output voltage,<br/>\[\begin{aligned}
\mathrm{V}_{0} &amp; =-2\left(1+\frac{1}{2}+\frac{1}{4}+0\right) \\
&amp; =-2(1.75) \\
&amp; =-3.5 \mathrm{~V}
\end{aligned}\]<br/>For the input \(\mathrm{b}_{3} \mathrm{~b}_{2} \mathrm{~b}_{1} \mathrm{~b}_{0}=1101\), the output voltage,<br/>\[\begin{aligned}
\mathrm{V}_{0} &amp; =-2\left(1+\frac{1}{2}+0+\frac{1}{8}\right) \\
&amp; =-2(1.625) \\
&amp; =-3.25 \mathrm{~V}
\end{aligned}\]<br/>So, the change in magnitude is 0.25 V and it is equal to 250 mV.

